# Third-party licences

## Model weights

None are here. edge-stt ships no model, and there is no `assets`
directory to put one in. The operator supplies the file, and the
library says which one it wants.

Before referencing a model anywhere in this repository — the README, a
test fixture, the measurement table — write it down below: what it is,
who published it, under what licence, where it came from, and the
checksum of the exact file that was used.

### Whisper (OpenAI)

The on-device backend runs Whisper in the GGML form whisper.cpp reads.
The weights are published by OpenAI under the MIT licence, and the GGML
conversions used in the documentation come from the whisper.cpp model
repository, `ggerganov/whisper.cpp` on Hugging Face.

